"""Build lesson.json and lesson.production-brief.json for the wave 4 designs (run from repo root).

Same method as build_g01_b2b.py. A design is built only when its Status line contains
"ready to voice"; the others are skipped and listed. Quoted lines ("> ...") are the
narration with **bold** cue markers stripped. Output is deterministic, so re-running
after a skipped design becomes ready does not change lesson.json bytes already built.
To add a skipped lesson, write its entry in LESSONS (ids, meta, progression, teaching,
design_block, rows, hold_seconds) from its design, then run:
    python docs/production/claude-pm/lessons/build_wave4.py
Optional arguments name the lesson keys to build (default: all registered).
"""
import io, re, json, os, sys, hashlib

